  "content": "\n\n<p>🛋️ <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>废弃城市建筑</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;</span>- <span style=\"color:#34495e\">末日装饰插件</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>说明：</strong></span></p>\n<p>本插件为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末世建筑：废弃城市建筑</a> 模组添加了来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日装饰</a> 的<strong>装饰性道具</strong>。<br>你的废墟建筑现在将更加身临其境 &mdash; 里面将会有<strong>尸体和血迹</strong>。</p>\n<p>本插件基于 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Berezka API</strong></span> 构建，因此需要安装以下模组才能正常运行：</p>\n<p>🛠️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>所需模组：</strong></span></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末世建筑：废弃城市建筑</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-city-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">废弃城市建筑 Berezka API</a></p>\n<p>🔗&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 依赖库</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日装饰</a></p>\n<p>💬 加入我们的 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Discord</span> 频道以获取最新动态并分享创意：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>俄文说明：</strong></span></p>\n<p>该模组为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末世建筑：废弃城市建筑</a> 的结构添加了来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日装饰</a> 的<strong>装饰性元素</strong>。<br>如今，这些废弃建筑将更具氛围感 &mdash; 内部将包含<strong>尸体与血迹</strong>。</p>\n<p>本模组基于 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>Berezka API</strong></span> 开发，因此需要安装额外的模组。</p>\n<p>🛠️ <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>所需模组：</strong></span></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abandoned-post-apocalyptic-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">末世建筑：废弃城市建筑</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-api-for-abandoned-city-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">废弃城市建筑 Berezka API</a></p>\n<p>🔗&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berezka-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berezka 依赖库</a></p>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末日装饰</a></p>\n<p>💬 加入我们的 Discord 服务器或 Telegram 频道，以跟踪更新、报告错误并提出建议：<br>👉 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/uAhSWWyqy3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>\n<p>👉&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fberezka_server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Telegram</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
